    "turn_idx": 5,
    "turn_text": "Okay, so let's begin with what's been changing with your proposals before Congress. We spoke about a year ago about an agricultural bill that you were introducing to Congress that lifted some restrictions on agricultural exports. We send to Cuba. And now you want to propose a different kind of bill. Can you tell me what's changed?",
