    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83468.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 10,
    "turn_text": "Well, you know, we've been from the beginning trying to be sensitive to the concerns of Cuban Americans, particularly those who are aggrieved and have certified claims, that we wanted them to be able to realize some benefit in this is not just strictly about trying to sell agricultural goods, but, you know, affecting policy that would positively impact them as well. And so this is just a way for us to reach out to broaden the base of support",
