    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Overall, we know that the administration, the current White House administration, will issue a Cuba review within some time in June, mid-June to the end of June. And what we've heard until now is that they're expecting changes from the Obama-Rapprochement policy. What do you think will come of the review?",
