        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Cash-on-delivery requirements represent a significant barrier to trade with Cuba.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker trusts that the current administration will prioritize long-standing issues over political continuity.",
